# Proxy handler errors include "proxy field access" stack frame context.
# The handler function is invoked via invoke_proxy_handler which labels the call
# "proxy field access" — this frame appears in the error stack trace.
# Note: "accessing .field" push_frame only applies to synchronous errors during
# handler invocation (e.g., handler not callable), not to errors raised inside the body.
[p: [proxy [fn [let key] [raise "proxy-error"]]]
 result: p.test]
=== error
[E080] proxy-error
